Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.26,0:01:01.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur4}{\i1}There's so much I want to tell you{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.26,0:01:01.76,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur4}{\i1}hanashitai koto takusan arun da{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.89,0:01:06.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur4}{\i1}Filled with love, with love{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.89,0:01:06.56,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur4}{\i1}ai kometa ai kometa{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.69,0:01:12.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur4}{\i1}That can't be written down in a letter{\i}
