Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.38,0:01:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, oh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.76,0:01:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mock? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.94,0:01:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.50,0:01:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's always laughing and\Ndancing to a rhythm like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.35,0:01:53.65,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\fad(200,1500)}"Kuma's Life"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.68,0:01:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma's Life.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.94,0:01:56.15,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(628,724)}2 YEARS AGO
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.10,0:02:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bonnie, Bonnie, Bonnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.06,0:02:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not just Bonnie, Captain Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.90,0:02:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, Captain, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.84,0:02:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kumachi is on that island.\NWhat? Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As sure as I can be!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.58,0:02:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Problem is, the place is\Nswarming with marines right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.46,0:02:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.66,0:02:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mainland Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.54,0:02:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.66,0:02:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.74,0:02:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the body pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,HQ said that they're a priority target!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.16,0:02:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everywhere they go, they leave\Ninjured children and senior citizens!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.68,0:02:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.59,0:02:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're too scared to pick on\Nsomeone who can fight back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.82,0:02:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's make these dirtbags pay! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.90,0:02:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.36,0:03:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kumaji!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.38,0:03:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on in, it's us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.02,0:03:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A big guy wearing black.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.00,0:03:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I just saw him\Non the edge of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.44,0:03:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.35,0:03:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's been a Kumaji satin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.02,0:03:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which way?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.51,0:03:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the edge of town! Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.10,0:03:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could explain, Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.26,0:03:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we can't see each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.62,0:03:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.22,0:03:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why wasn't he there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.38,0:03:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't rush it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates like us have all\Nthe time in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.62,0:03:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.98,0:03:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nika.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.36,0:03:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to look for Nika, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.18,0:03:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, when I do find Dad, I\Ncan tell him I met his hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.22,0:03:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be so excited.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.19,0:03:56.73,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(296,554)}{\fad(300,0)}Meanwhile in
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.19,0:03:56.73,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1618,554)}{\fad(300,0)}the East Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.54,0:03:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, in the east blue...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.26,0:04:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The upstart pirate Straw Hat\NLuffy suddenly rose to prominence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.52,0:04:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after taking down Arlong and his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.94,0:04:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.14,0:04:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a real bounty!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.75,0:04:15.54,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1526,266)}"Straw Hat Luffy"
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.54,0:04:15.62,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1647,266)}Luffy"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.06,0:04:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm headed out to Log Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.36,0:04:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.68,0:04:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want me to come along?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.14,0:04:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for the record,\Nwho is in charge there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.10,0:04:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should be Captain Smoker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.88,0:04:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinbei, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you guess how I know this pirate here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.30,0:04:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy is my little brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.76,0:04:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, he's what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.10,0:04:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kid who beat the Arlong\NPirates is your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.66,0:04:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Funny how things work out, huh, Dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.28,0:04:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of our children became pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.16,0:04:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the iron code that\Nall pirates must live by.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.60,0:04:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plunder all treasure in sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plunder! Treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.52,0:04:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only from bad guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never show mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.76,0:04:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.82,0:04:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But be nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.12,0:05:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.48,0:05:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You nailed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.78,0:05:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm not an expert,\Nbut it looks good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.68,0:05:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.46,0:05:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I put some jewelry on my cheeks so\NDad can recognize me without my gems.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.44,0:05:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now all that's left is to get famous!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.06,0:05:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way he'll be able\Nto find me for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.24,0:05:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll find me. Right, Dad?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.94,0:05:25.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1358,526)}Egghead, \NNew World
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.92,0:05:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very unsettling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.36,0:05:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.78,0:05:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But these clones and your modifications\Nare going to change the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.02,0:05:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And speaking of itch,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.40,0:05:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did you hear about the pirate who\Ndeclared war on the government?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.80,0:05:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot down that flag. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.50,0:05:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.41,0:05:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boy is Dragon Son, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.46,0:05:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll see my memories eventually, so\Nthere's no point in hiding it from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.28,0:05:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What caught my attention is that Straw Hat
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.40,0:05:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fights for freedom with\Nthe power of rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.46,0:05:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sounds a lot like my hero. Nika.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.64,0:05:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He does indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.34,0:05:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Bomb: Giant Jet Show!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.90,0:06:10.57,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1660,978)}Thriller Bark, \NGrand Line
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.24,0:06:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My orders are to annihilate\Nevery last one of you without
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.60,0:06:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,exception but i will spare your\Nlives in exchange for the head of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat luffy the government\Nshould be satisfied with his life
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.22,0:06:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,alone you want us to betray our
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.16,0:06:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,captain not a chance what a pity
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you want someone's head\Nfine i'll give you one but
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.04,0:06:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i can't let you have my\Ncaptains So take mine instead
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.26,0:06:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because Luffy is the man\Nwho will become king of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the pirates If you truly\Nwish to take his place
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.96,0:06:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be willing to\Naccept his agony yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.20,0:06:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This would be enough\Nto knock me unconscious
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.30,0:07:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He inspires such loyalty in his friends
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.56,0:07:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He couldn't be anyone's\Nson but yours, dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seven warlords, report in immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.08,0:07:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Refuse and lose your title.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.14,0:07:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's awfully dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Preparations for the\Nexecution of Porcus D.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.14,0:07:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.05,0:07:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a standard bearer\Nto the new generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.10,0:07:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's a son to Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.16,0:07:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We expect war.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.26,0:07:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A war with the Whitebeard pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.20,0:07:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll be there.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.53,0:07:32.99,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1554,758)}Sabaody Archipelago
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.68,0:07:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the rest of the food?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.54,0:07:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring it before I starve! Pizza!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.20,0:07:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get more pizza!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.30,0:07:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, I swear they're cooking as\Nfast as I can! Really? Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.68,0:07:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't make a scene, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.56,0:07:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be the last\Ntime I see you, Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.92,0:07:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've become quite the\Npirate, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.62,0:07:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pirate punched a celestial dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Human shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.44,0:08:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can someone attack a celestial dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.50,0:08:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole world knows that's forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.22,0:08:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to do it so close to\NNavy HQ, this is suicide!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.08,0:08:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.44,0:08:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.70,0:08:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they trying to protect\Na fish man and a mermaid?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.08,0:08:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you done, Straw Hat Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.24,0:08:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an unimaginable act of rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one has even attempted such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.34,0:08:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.54,0:09:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand down, Pucci.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.48,0:09:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dragon... Eva...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.84,0:09:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me for disappearing\Nwithout a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.08,0:09:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I leave only two things behind as\Nproof that I existed in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.68,0:09:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lonnie, and the future of\Nthis boy, Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.88,0:09:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't save any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.14,0:09:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.74,0:09:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing, but this is how\Nharsh the new world will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.52,0:09:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and your friends aren't ready\Nfor it You must grow stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.32,0:10:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when the time comes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.72,0:10:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday you'll save this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.54,0:10:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A self-destruct switch Do you\Nreally fear Kuma that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.58,0:10:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did turn him into a deadly\Nhuman weapon Did you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.42,0:10:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're at the top of his authority ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.20,0:10:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if he goes berserk when we're out of\Ncommand range, who will stop him and how?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.72,0:10:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.94,0:10:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cease your insolence,\Nyou paltry hired hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll do as you ask, but\Nplease let him keep some free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.44,0:10:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've invented a brain circuit that\Ncan toggle between personality modes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.56,0:10:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will be easy to install,\NI promise you just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.86,0:10:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave you a very clear order, Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroy every trace of his free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.42,0:10:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're both men of science.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.26,0:10:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't fool me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:10:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what will become of his daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.02,0:10:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What of Bonnie?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.22,0:11:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He will never see her again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.94,0:11:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for trying, Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.66,0:11:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't hear all of that, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.50,0:11:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out a scientist gave\Nme superhuman hearing.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.92,0:11:22.34,Note-207+,,0,0,0,,"Justice"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, today's the day\Nyou lose your free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.34,0:11:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've only known you for two years,\Nbut we've had some good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.56,0:11:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems your first mission will be a large-scale\Nfight against the Whitebeard pilots.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.50,0:11:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Navy's requesting a\Nmassive deployment of clones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.42,0:11:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wouldn't mind, could you\Nprogram one more mission after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.62,0:11:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to guard the Strawhead's ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.90,0:11:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until one of his crewmates comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to help them protect their home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.80,0:11:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.16,0:12:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish that I could watch\Ntheir journey to the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.66,0:12:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it that you expect from that boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His actions move my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.28,0:12:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how else to put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.20,0:12:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a legend come to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.74,0:12:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know Nika is just an old folk tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.22,0:12:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I told Bonnie that there's a warrior\Nwho moves to the rhythm of liberation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.94,0:12:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and brings smiles to all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.72,0:12:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there really is a hero who\Ncan change the world like Nika?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.56,0:12:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it'll be Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.90,0:12:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A revolutionary betting on a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've chosen quite a dark horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.44,0:12:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a contradiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.26,0:12:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Proof you're still human.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.96,0:12:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, about that sample for my research.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.40,0:12:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had a deal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.94,0:12:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you push your memories\Ninto a paw like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.86,0:12:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you forget them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.06,0:12:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's like a copy, but it will\Nvanish after someone touches it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.70,0:12:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.98,0:12:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I devised a method to study it remotely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.60,0:12:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.02,0:13:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.44,0:13:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Purely clinical, I am a scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.70,0:13:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.64,0:13:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.28,0:13:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder how many people I've\Ntroubled through the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.34,0:13:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Troubled, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.74,0:13:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, to live is to trouble others.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.82,0:14:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, what age\Ndid you become a slave?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.98,0:14:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was four.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same as me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.84,0:14:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kumachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.24,0:14:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the eldest here by four years, so\Nthat means it's my job to keep you fed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.12,0:14:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kumachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.66,0:14:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.66,0:14:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's sell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.54,0:14:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kumachi! Kumachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kumachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.96,0:14:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm full!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.38,0:15:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm full!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.64,0:15:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm full!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.68,0:15:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.40,0:15:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kumachi...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.80,0:15:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll always, always, love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Ginny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.14,0:15:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll raise your daughter as my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.86,0:15:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.36,0:15:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.74,0:15:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those little jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.24,0:15:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were making fun\Nof my face rocks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.18,0:16:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could throw them at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.28,0:16:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess they are kind of ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.46,0:16:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm stuck with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.10,0:16:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're permanent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.46,0:16:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.76,0:16:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your daughter has five\Nyears to live at most.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.64,0:16:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She would be beating the odds just\Nto make it to her 10th birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.22,0:16:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid your mother's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.86,0:16:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that means she's in heaven now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.14,0:16:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be okay, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.04,0:16:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.40,0:16:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just have to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.30,0:16:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'd be better off dead, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.40,0:16:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The warrior of liberation will\Nsave you. Have faith. He'll come.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.70,0:16:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.24,0:16:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.98,0:16:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.02,0:16:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't lose anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.48,0:16:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't lose anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.54,0:17:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mock?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.90,0:17:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.04,0:17:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.66,0:17:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean he'll come and free me too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.22,0:17:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mass of pain and suffering\Nwon't just go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.14,0:17:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, someone has to accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.50,0:17:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never forget, those hands\Ncan do more than pray.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the hands of liberation!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.70,0:17:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.90,0:17:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can help Bonney get well,\Nthen I'll happily accept any fate.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.44,0:17:50.19,Note-207+,,0,0,0,,"Dad"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.78,0:17:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any fate at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.22,0:17:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nika, the Sun God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.78,0:17:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll show up and deliver\Nus all to freedom one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.80,0:18:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll take you to the sea,\Nbeneath the free skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.88,0:18:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's no joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.62,0:18:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My disease will be all gone in a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.28,0:18:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I can finally go outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I pick you up, we'll take to the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.80,0:18:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From there, it's an endless\Nhorizon. Can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.10,0:18:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to go all kinds of places!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.10,0:18:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.28,0:18:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since I was young, I've had a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.26,0:18:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.30,0:18:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone who could save the downtrodden\Nand free people from suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.30,0:19:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.88,0:19:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma-chi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.36,0:19:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.28,0:19:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.66,0:19:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma-chi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll cure her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.48,0:19:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy, you're home!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.04,0:19:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.82,0:19:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.06,0:19:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, to live is to trouble others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.68,0:20:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your death will trouble\Neveryone who loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.56,0:20:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's proof of a life they lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.92,0:20:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tell you, Kuma, you are a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Bonnie's hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.86,0:20:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're everyone's hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.58,0:20:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're too kind, Vang.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.58,0:20:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.04,0:20:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.64,0:20:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.54,0:20:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mock?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.48,0:20:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.10,0:20:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean he'll\Ncome and free me, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.08,0:20:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.98,0:20:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Vegapunk, for saving Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.66,0:21:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you pass on a message for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.90,0:21:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next time you see her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.18,0:21:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.98,0:21:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy 10th birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.94,0:21:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll be home to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.42,0:21:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should go to my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.40,0:21:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one can be my hair.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.74,0:21:37.04,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}I can't protect anyone again
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.74,0:21:37.04,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}mata daremo mamorenai no
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.76,0:21:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The voice of my voice is me.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.04,0:21:41.84,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}It's my fault that the voice is fading away
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.04,0:21:41.84,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}kiekakaru koe wa boku no sei
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.76,0:21:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long should I take my hand?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.84,0:21:44.13,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}I don't even have time to look down
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.84,0:21:44.13,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}utsumuku hima mo nai no
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.86,0:21:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see the next one.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.13,0:21:46.72,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Gravel marks on my palms
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.13,0:21:46.72,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}tenohira ni tsuku jari no ato
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.72,0:21:50.10,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Start moving again, my ship
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.72,0:21:50.10,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}mata ugokidase boku no fune yo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.84,0:21:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then move me.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.51,0:21:55.60,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Though I can't fly in the broad sky
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.51,0:21:55.60,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}hiroi sora wa tobenai kedo
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.60,0:22:01.48,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}I can light up the deep sea
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.60,0:22:01.48,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}fukai umi wa teraseru kara
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.61,0:22:02.44,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}bokura wa
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.61,0:22:02.44,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}We
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.53,0:22:04.94,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}EVERYDAY owarenai
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.53,0:22:04.94,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}EVERYDAY, can't let this be the end
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.94,0:22:07.57,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}EVERYDAY makerenai
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.94,0:22:07.57,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}EVERYDAY, can't be defeated
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.57,0:22:11.33,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}mamoru mono ga koko niwa aru
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.57,0:22:11.33,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}We have something here to protect
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.37,0:22:13.87,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}yosou chigai kamo?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.37,0:22:13.87,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}This may not be what I expected
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.95,0:22:16.58,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}tomarenai yo mou
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.95,0:22:16.58,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}But we can't stop now
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.66,0:22:21.88,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}kodoku wo ima wakeai susumu
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.66,0:22:21.88,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}We go on, sharing loneliness
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.00,0:22:24.63,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}ojikedukuna yo
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.00,0:22:24.63,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Don't be afraid
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.71,0:22:28.59,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}ano hi no boku to chigau kara
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.71,0:22:28.59,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}I'm not the same person I was that day
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.63,0:22:32.05,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}dare nimo jama dekinai yo
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.63,0:22:32.05,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}No one can stand in my way
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.81,0:22:33.68,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}saa doite
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.81,0:22:33.68,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Now, move aside
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.72,0:22:36.27,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}sekai wo seishite mirai wo shinjite
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.72,0:22:36.27,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Conquer the world, believe in the future
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.39,0:22:38.85,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}ikutsu mono yoru kazoete
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.39,0:22:38.85,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Count up the nights
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.85,0:22:41.56,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}nani wo mite nani wo shitte
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.85,0:22:41.56,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}What did you see? What did you learn?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.56,0:22:44.57,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}taisetsu na koto ni kiduita no
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.56,0:22:44.57,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}To realize what was important

